<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harwill says to list Prospur unit on JSE.</title>
<headline>Harwill says to list Prospur unit on JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harwill Investments Ltd said on Friday it planned to list its Prospur Packaging and Plastics Ltd unit on the Joghannesburg Stock Exchnage by way of a renounceable offer for subscription and a renounceable offer for sale.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the subscription offer to raise five million rand, before expenses, in Prospur and the sale offer to raise eight million rand in Harwill.</p>
<p>The last day to register is July 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
